-- 009: faction base values and class / race / deity modifiers from the Quarm (EQMacEmu) database.
--
-- Ours were mostly empty: 90 of 391 factions had race modifiers, Antonius Bayle and the Guards of
-- Qeynos none at all, so a troll stood like a human with them (#showfaction showed it); 139 bases
-- differed too (Orc 0 here, -500 there; Mucktail Gnolls -75, -750). Factions are matched by name,
-- ignoring case and spaces (356 of 391; the others are unchanged). Quarm's faction_list_mod keys
-- c<class>, r<race>, d<deity> fill our mod_ columns (0 where Quarm has none); mod_d140 (agnostic)
-- is kept. Players' own standings are not touched.
--
-- Old values: table faction_list_before_009. Idempotent.
